ame": "2024 HG screen 3.png", "id": "422911767473865", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974552_422911770807198_2018748843549627820_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-z9MurJIBAsQ7kNvwFyLpYF&_nc_oc=AdnzD5yTZaOikP1wbpKiHSKYNvpHPMD7tD_8ScqFGGm1nG9hR0vxU6RadGjc0h_GA2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzYQa1TLb8CbtW5F1dRf9_7cIvDXlxeNcoYHtoZtaM1CA&oe=69BEA0A8"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 4.png", "id": "1054432909633298", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_1054432912966631_7046083185660917993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G6Ag9OLl06oQ7kNvwHdN-qC&_nc_oc=AdmLodxSW5XzFY5ShCij0o3_x5QSvVRslLZ2ryodpYD9gZ7rU3onqLzfq7iL-bLCOgQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxVqDqXqo-NOxxbYZp-DuwzMPqom136I6Qfj7yxisnZSQ&oe=69BEA922"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 1.png", "id": "527879776285288", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75557067_527879779618621_2727265542105493653_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BXkGF8X7LP0Q7kNvwGT9Nr5&_nc_oc=Adm3vjv90szSc3p7tOkhZ9BU3Zqt2sDwDps3L8r812n_ZrQ3NJo8W3pIifuyRkPR2Jg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzChn_1rEO2FG9ih6-pVnil1bveJipsjM1Pd3lKOC4S-w&oe=69BE8C61"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 2.png", "id": "3704187989892735", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982651_3704187993226068_2653672913754187359_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0sAATzjGg8MQ7kNvwHqHqZ3&_nc_oc=Adkv96fB6Am27AxK4nKbdYUWiALmM8Dw6Y63vcy1-8EfcVxOEra-GYKc-OLfKp-EXXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzo0I1nJXI2P_rA-j3Tk3q2v_p3X_YPCjK5yw-lo1XctA&oe=69BEA77A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2024 HG Meta  Cover art.png", "id": "1870037076837448", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sog3TroKjLsQ7kNvwExd09i&_nc_oc=AdnXnb4YBtY6wGHnN8sBpn-I8lwFEmpbu-Oe1KwpCPc1ZuxVYT1PkvG5XYoJYZg_94A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyBP5Vrn56lGtFN-wSClBHfqp1kzuyueGYkYmgDnCILPg&oe=69BE84A5"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_